commit dfdc5d59205f680306ce429f73240f28e9332b1f
Author: 仓鼠王 <yjianbin419@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 22 19:37:50 2026 +0800

    fix(frontend): the caveat must mean something, the announcement retires, and a refused press reveals its reason (ORD-0220 ①②)
    
    Three arms the red team and HJ-P1 measured and my gates did not see:
    
    - the tight advisory only proved two strings co-occur, so appending a reassurance to the
      caveat stayed green while the screen contradicted itself; the new node asserts which word
      classes the caveat may contain (killX1/killX2 both red)
    - #trial-next-reason rendered a snapshot of the missing-list, so a screen-reader user kept
      hearing 还需要填写：总预算 after the field was fixed; the sentence is now bound to the
      missing-set it was spoken for (killY1 red), and ORD-0086's re-announcement still passes
    - a blocked 下一步 left its reason at y=1224 in an 844px viewport; the press now scrolls the
      reason into view (killZ1 red).  Focus is deliberately not delivered: making the paragraph
      focusable trips ORD-0066's negative control on that same element, and I will not edit
      another order's instrument to go green
    
    probe-ord0220-budget-conflict.py answers the lodging>total question black-box: POST 201 and
    PATCH 200 with both figures persisted in one currency, so that cell is a backend truth order.

